# Frontend conventions

- App Router under `frontend/app/`; shared `Shell` and `lib/api`
- Call real backend APIs; never fake module success in the UI
- No pre-filled production logins or demo credentials in client code
- Preserve existing ERP screen patterns unless the task redesigns a surface
- Surface API errors clearly; do not swallow failures as silent success
